{{ENExclusive}}
'''Nekokkuma''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] unlocked by logging in during the [[Betakkuma Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 433
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Nekokkuma
|name2 = Killer Nekokkuma
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Killer Nekokkuma''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Since this unit has such a low chance to knockback Dark enemies, it almost always fails to do so due to its low stats, most notably range. Can overall be seen as a bootleg version of [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Tin Cat]] or as a meatshield with double cost for virtually no benefit. Due to not being good at either of his possible roles, the use of this unit is not recommended. His niche is also useless since Dark enemies already have a high knockback count.

Due to its rapid attack rate, it can be somewhat good for taking out [[Metal Hippoe]]s and, in some stages, [[Metal Doge]]s. Otherwise, he's good for [[User Rank]].

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

