==Trivia==
*Neko means cat and kuma means bear. Nekokkuma is Cat Bear while Killer Nekokkuma is Killer Cat Bear. Each of them have the corresponding Cat's head.
*The "weirdly cute white bear" mentioned in this unit's description is [[Betakkuma (Rare Cat)|Betakkuma]], who is also described as a "weirdly cute white bear". Strangely, although Nekokkuma means Cat Bear, it takes human body (lower) half of Betakkuma rather than the bear (upper) half.

